# Solid Community Group and its Technical Reports.
#
# The W3C crawl already provides <https://www.w3.org/community/solid/> as an
# ex:Group with its name, shortname, members, W3C API link and W3C scope. This
# file only adds the shared Solid scope and the links to the specifications, so
# the same group appears under both:
#
#   ?sdo=https://www.w3.org/
#   ?sdo=https://solidproject.org/
#
# Nothing about the group itself is duplicated: its members and W3C identifiers
# keep coming from the generated W3C dump.
#
# Sources: https://solidproject.org/TR/
#          https://www.w3.org/community/solid/
# Snapshot: 2026-11-23.
#
# Seeded with `devbox run seed -- static` (see scripts/fuseki.ts).

@prefix ex: <http://example.org#> .

<https://www.w3.org/community/solid/> ex:sdo <https://solidproject.org/> ;
  ex:specification
    <https://solidproject.org/TR/protocol> ,
    <https://solid.github.io/webid-profile/> ,
    <https://solidproject.org/TR/oidc> ,
